      "points": ["gp-sentence-basics"],
      "question": "In *Men Gülşat* (I'm Gülşat), which word means **am**?",
      "options": ["None: Turkmen leaves it out", "men", "Gülşat"],
      "optionsLang": "en",
      "answer": 0,
      "why": {
        "1": "*men* means **I**.",
        "2": "*Gülşat* is the name."
      },
      "explain": "In the present, **to be** is often not said: *Men Gülşat* is literally “I Gülşat”."
    },
